#: index.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"That should be all that is needed on &Linux; - just copy the files into "
"<filename>/etc/hotplug/usb/</filename>, and when the mouse is plugged in, "
"the ownership and permissions should be changed so that the user at the "
"console can access the mouse."
